## Стек

**Python 3.14t (free-threaded, PEP 779, ABI cp314t)** с `PYTHON_GIL=0`, FastAPI, **Granian** (Rust ASGI, не uvicorn — CI-gate `make check-no-uvicorn`), PostgreSQL (pgvector), Redis, TaskIQ, UV, OpenFGA, Centrifugo, Lit 3, нативный EventBus + фабрики (`createAsyncOp`/`createResourceCollection`/`createCursorList`/`createFacets`/`createForm`/`createSlice`).

